  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-379-408">芹をつむ芹の沼べり</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-408-423">今日もまた</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-423-465"><seg source="#source-423-432">めだか</seg></hi><seg source="#source-465-479">が浮いた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-479-508">肩あげの肩が細いと</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-508-545">あの人はやさしく言つた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-545-580">名も知らぬ小鳥が鳴いた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-580-609">讃岐の山雲が通つた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-609-638">あの人は麦笛ふいた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-638-647">泪ぐみ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-647-665"><rb>昼月</rb><rt>つき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-665-684">みて聴いた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-684-716">肩あげの肩も抱かずに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-716-737">あの人は黙つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-737-749"><rb>去</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-749-757">つた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-757-789">芹かごの芹のかほりが</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-789-819">しんしんと胸に沈んだ</seg></p>
    </body>
